   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:small;color:#000000\">Dear distance samplers,<br><br>I have successfully modelled dolphin population size using the &#39;Distance&#39; package in R. <br>As I am using data from a very heterogeneous area in terms of oceanographic features, I&#39;ve  decided to go forward  and use the &#39;dsm&#39; package to include environmental covariates.<br><br>However, I have to deal with zero inflation and I don&#39;t know how to do that using &#39;dsm&#39; (?).<br>Does anyone have an explanation and/or solution to my question?</div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:small;color:#000000\"><br>With kind regards,<br><br><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">--</span><br></div><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><div><font face=\"georgia, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:x-small;color:rgb(133,90,64)\"> </span></font><span style=\"color:inherit;font-size:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;border:0px;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:Candara,Optima,sans-serif;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"><b>Thayusky da Penha Correa</b></span><span style=\"color:inherit;font-size:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;border:0px;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:Candara,Optima,sans-serif;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"> (she/her)</span></div><div style=\"border:0px;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(32,33,36)\"><font color=\"#444444\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\"><div style=\"font:inherit;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:Candara,Optima,sans-serif;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\">Ph.D. student in Ecology<br>Universidade Federal de Santa Catarina<br><span class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:georgia,serif;font-size:small;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"></span><br></span></div></span></font></div></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:HelveticaNeue-Light,&quot;Helvetica Neue Light&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,Arial,&quot;Lucida Grande&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(128,128,128);font-family:verdana,helvetica,sans-serif\"><font size=\"1\"><br></font></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n"
